      "content": "I think my previous message might have been too broad. To be more specific, I'm looking for a formal academic summary of the current scholarly debate. \n\nCould you outline the core arguments used by originalists when interpreting the Second Amendment's text and historical context, and then contrast that with how living constitutionalists approach the same amendment in light of modern societal changes and technology?",
